---
---

<section class="cta-strip" aria-label="Contacto">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-inner reveal">
      <h2 class="cta-headline">
        Hay conversaciones que vale la pena tener.
      </h2>
      <p class="cta-sub">
        Si estás evaluando cómo su organización comunica —o debería
        comunicar— podemos ser un buen punto de partida.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/contacto" class="btn btn-cta-coral">Contactar a Facética</a>
        <a href="mailto:hola@facetica.com" class="cta-email">hola@facetica.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-strip {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);
    padding-block: var(--space-120);
  }

  .cta-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .cta-headline {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-inverse);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-24);
  }

  /* Coral button on dark background */
  .btn-cta-coral {
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    border-radius: 100px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out),
                border-color var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .btn-cta-coral:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .cta-sub {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(245, 242, 237, 0.65);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-48);
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-24);
  }

  .cta-email {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: rgba(245, 242, 237, 0.5);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245, 242, 237, 0.2);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color var(--duration-fast), border-color var(--duration-fast);
  }

  .cta-email:hover {
    color: var(--color-text-inverse);
    border-color: rgba(245, 242, 237, 0.5);
  }

  /* ── Mobile ── */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .cta-strip {
      padding-block: var(--space-80);
    }

    .btn-inverse {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>
